CATEGORIES:storytime,library,baby,toddler,family,Special Events
DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Irvine Public Library - Heritage Park\\nCost: free\
 \nAges: 0-60 months\\nCategory: Storytime\\n\\nThrow it back to the golden
  age of school book fairs! Adults are invited to relive the magic of a 199
 0s Scholastic Book Fair—minus the permission slips. Browse retro-inspire
 d book displays\, enjoy cozy nostalgia\, and celebrate the books that shap
 ed a generation. Whether you were all about Goosebumps\, Animorphs\, or th
 e book of cool erasers you begged your parents for\, this library event is
  a love letter to readers who grew up in the stacks. \n\nAdults 18\\n\\nMo
 re info: https://irvinepubliclibrary.libcal.com/event/16750469
LOCATION:Heritage Park Library Community Room \, Heritage Park Library
URL:https://irvinepubliclibrary.libcal.com/event/16750469
