BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[FREE] Artists in Action &#8211\; Sawdust Art Festival’s Art Edu
 cation Depa…
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260705T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260705T120000
DTSTAMP:20260703T103932Z
UID:030d650276fb302870bd8f2e6e56d705@family-events-agent
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:children,play,toddler,museum,family
DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Pretend City Children's Museum - Events\\nCost: Fre
 e\\nAges: 0-60 months\\nCategory: Play & Games\\n\\nArtists in Action with
  Sawdust Art Festival’s Art Education Department invites families to e
 xplore creativity together through hands-on experiences led by real artist
 s. Each visit offers new materials\, fresh ideas\, and playful ways for ch
 ildren to express themselves and connect through art.  \nTimes: 11am-12
 pm  \n* Join us anytime between 11 am – 12 pm for this drop-in experi
 ence.  \nIncluded with museum admission  \nBooks will be available for
  purchase during the event.  \nSpace may be limited.  \n*Events and ti
 mes are subject to change. \nAbout the play partner: Sawdust Art Festiva
 l’s Art Education Department \nLocated in the heart of Laguna Beach’s
  iconic eucalyptus grove\, the Sawdust Art Festival’s Art Education De
 partment is dedicated to nurturing the artist in everyone. We believe that
  art isn’t just something to be viewed\, it’s something to be ex
 perienced firsthand.  \nOur mission is to provide a vibrant\, hands-on e
 nvironment where creativity knows no bounds. Whether you are a seasoned ma
 ker or picking up a brush for the first time\, our department offers a div
 erse array of workshops and demonstrations led by professional working a
 rtists.  \nWhat We Offer: \n\nSawdust Art Classes: Year-round workshops
  in specialized mediums like glassblowing\, ceramics\, jewelry making\, p
 ainting\, and more.  \n\n\nFestival Magic: During our summer and winter 
 shows\, we provide daily\, complimentary art projects at our three art stu
 dios.  \n\n\nCommunity Connection: We bridge the gap between the public 
 and the local artist community by bringing the Sawdust experience to you!
  We provide specialized programming for youth organizations\, private gro
 ups\, and community events. All tailored to inspire creativity in any set
 ting.  \n\nFrom the tactile thrill of throwing clay on a potter’s wh
 eel to the delicate art of watercolor\, we invite you to step into our &#
 8220\;outdoor studio&#8221\; and leave with more than just a souvenir\, le
 ave with a new skill and a spark of inspiration.\\n\\nMore info: https://w
 ww.pretendcity.org/events/artists-in-action-sawdust-art-festivals-art-educ
 ation-department/
LOCATION:Pretend City Children's Museum - Events\, 29 Hubble\, Irvine\, CA
 \, 92618
URL:https://www.pretendcity.org/events/artists-in-action-sawdust-art-festi
 vals-art-education-department/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Tomorrow: Artists in Action &#8211\; Sawdust Art Festival’s 
 Art Educati
TRIGGER:-P1D
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:In 2 hours: Artists in Action &#8211\; Sawdust Art Festival’
 s Art Educati
TRIGGER:-PT2H
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
