 ry to life capturing his battlefield bravery\, personal struggles\, and li
 felong dedication to supporting veterans affected by Post-Traumatic Stress
  Disorder.\n\nGenerously funded by the Friends of the Katie Wheeler Librar
 y.\\n\\nMore info: https://irvinepubliclibrary.libcal.com/event/16955135
