BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Artists in Action with Chuck Jones
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260725T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260725T140000
DTSTAMP:20260703T103932Z
UID:e67c6bc79b4b948922218b95a0ca8f32@family-events-agent
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:children,play,toddler,museum,family
DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Pretend City Children's Museum - Events\\nAges: 0-6
 0 months\\nCategory: Play & Games\\n\\nArtists in Action with Chuck Jones
  Center for Creativity invites families to explore creativity together 
 through hands-on experiences led by real artists. Each visit offers new ma
 terials\, fresh ideas\, and playful ways for children to express themselve
 s and connect through art.\nTimes: 11am-12pm \nAbout the play partner: 
 \nFounded upon the time-honored philosophies of legendary\, Oscar-winning 
 animation director Chuck Jones\, the Chuck Jones Center for Creativity is 
 a 501c3 charity dedicated to stimulating innovative thinking\, individual
  expression and interpersonal collaboration – on its mission to nurtur
 e creative solutions to some of society’s most urgent and unmet needs. O
 ur programs for youth (including those on the autism spectrum)\, adults of
  all ages\, schools\, businesses and organizational teams focus on eleva
 ting\, celebrating and accelerating the creative genius in all of us\, a
 ll for the betterment of the individuals\, the groups and the communitie
 s we serve.\nFrequently Asked Questions \nIs this program included with
  museum admission?\nYes. Artists in Action is included with regular mus
 eum admission. \nWhat ages is this program best for?\nThis experience is 
 designed for children ages 0–8 and their families. \nIs this a structur
 ed class?\nNo. This is a drop-in\, open-ended creative experience where fa
 milies can participate at their own pace. \nWhen should we arrive?\nFam
 ilies can drop in anytime between 11:00 am and 1:45 pm. \nWill materials 
 be provided?\nYes. All materials are provided as part of the experience. 
 \nWill Chuck Jones Center for Creativity be back?\nYes. The Chuck Jones Ce
 nter for Creativity will return for additional sessions on August 22. \n
 Who is Chuck Jones?\nChuck Jones was a legendary\, Oscar-winning animation
  director best known for creating and directing beloved characters like Bu
 gs Bunny\, Daffy Duck\, and the Road Runner. His legacy continues through 
 the Chuck Jones Center for Creativity\, which inspires people of all ages 
 to explore creativity and innovation. \n*Please note programming lasts 10
 -30 minutes. \nIncluded with museum admission \nBooks will be available 
 for purchase during the event.\nSpace may be limited. \n*Events and times
  are subject to change.\nThis exhibit is included in museum admission. Sp
 ace is limited! Book your tickets now.\\n\\nMore info: https://www.prete
 ndcity.org/events/artists-in-action-with-chuck-jones-2026-07-25/
LOCATION:Pretend City Children's Museum - Events\, 29 Hubble\, Irvine\, CA
 \, 92618
URL:https://www.pretendcity.org/events/artists-in-action-with-chuck-jones-
 2026-07-25/
